    slug: "live-transfer-medicare-leads",
    title: "Live Transfer Medicare Leads: A Complete Guide",
    metaTitle: "Live Transfer Medicare Leads Guide",
    excerpt: "A complete guide to how live transfer Medicare leads work and how agents can use them effectively.",
    metaDescription: "A complete guide to how live transfer Medicare leads work, including pricing, call-quality standards, and how agents can put them to use effectively.",
